[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-015
METHOD: Test
TITLE: AI settings
STATEMENT: >>>
Only administrators read and change the settings; the AI buddy starts switched off and switching it off keeps the other settings; the context size is validated; the key is shown only by its last four characters and an empty key keeps the stored one; the settings page loads for administrators only and states that data goes to Google.
<<<
