backend/tests/test_ai_buddy.py: test_admin_sets_key_model_and_prompt, test_list_models_keeps_generating_models, test_switch_turns_the_ai_buddy_off, test_new_settings_start_switched_off, test_history_follows_the_context_setting
backend/tests/test_web_pages.py: test_admin_login_and_logout, test_regular_user_is_kept_out_of_admin_pages
<<<
