[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-017
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Unavailable and failing AI buddy
STATEMENT: >>>
Without settings, or while switched off, the status is 'not configured' and messages get the Dutch error; connection errors, timeouts and 5xx are tried three times in total after 1 and 2 seconds, 4xx once; a final failure gives the Dutch error, keeps the message, and sending it again does not duplicate it.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_ai_buddy.py: test_unavailable_until_configured, test_switch_turns_the_ai_buddy_off, test_gemini_failure_keeps_the_message, test_transient_failures_are_retried
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-083
  ROLE: Verifies

